    "condition": "The law factorizes as \\(P_{\\mathrm{bin}}(H_{\\mathrm{bin}},X_{\\mathrm{bin}})=\\prod_{k=1}^KP_{\\mathrm{bin}}((H_{\\mathrm{bin}})_k\\mid(H_{\\mathrm{bin}})_{\\operatorname{pa}_{\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{bin}}}(k)})\\prod_{j=1}^JP_{\\mathrm{bin}}((X_{\\mathrm{bin}})_j\\mid(H_{\\mathrm{bin}})_{\\operatorname{pa}_{\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{bin}}}(j)})\\).",
    "free_symbols": [
      "\\(P_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\)",
